<section class="content-section reveal">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6">
    <div class="prose-content">
      <p>The problem: operating across the Middle East and Africa means navigating a patchwork of data protection laws, industry-specific regulations, and cross-border transfer rules that change frequently. A compliance approach that works in one country may not satisfy another, and the cost of getting it wrong ranges from fines to operational shutdown.</p>

      <p>The approach: MEAICON assesses your current compliance posture against the specific regulations that apply to your industry and geography. We identify gaps, prioritise remediation, and build a plan that your team can actually execute — not a legal opinion that sits in a drawer.</p>

      <p>Outcomes: a compliance register, gap analysis, remediation roadmap, and a monitoring framework to keep you current as regulations evolve across the region.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

